Algol 68 Genie is a well-featured Algol 68 interpreter. It can be used
for executing Algol 68 programs or scripts. Algol 68 is a rather lean,
orthogonal general-purpose programming language that is a beautiful
means for denoting algorithms. Algol 68 Genie is free software,
distributed under the GNU General Public License.

I have posted Algol 68 Genie Version 1.18.0 at

http://www.xs4all.nl/~jmvdveer/algol.html

I would like to thank all persons who have helped over the past years.
Algol 68 Genie would not be what it is without their help.

Marcel van der Veer

